# Murder on the Hill (Quest 5, v520); no published walkthrough -- derived
# entirely from source. Culprit: Dr Matthews (son of the maid Betty/Elizabeth
# Sinfield). Game starts in the greenhouse. The "Final denouement" turnscript
# fires the moment player.evid reaches 27 (here: on 'give dagger to major',
# the last piece of evidence needed), gathers everyone in the lounge, and
# 'point to matthews' ends the game. Chains: veronica 'alive' -> lady mary
# 'elizabeth'; matthews 'enemies' -> simon 'clubs'; lady mary 'person' -> simon
# 'womanizer'; hacksaw (oak seat) -> beheaded waxwork -> head into furnace +
# matches (desk drawer, lock broken with the dagger) -> douse with sand -> iron
# key -> crypt gate; sarcophagus combination (58/58/58 under the oracle's seed)
# opens the roof-window safe (rope from hut tea chest, ring cuts the glass).
# Boots hold the brass key for the island hut; the towel needs soap + washtub
# before its DS initials show. 'look at hole'/'look at bath' are needed:
